    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "📻 \"Why do the small humans keep putting organic matter in their FACE-HOLES? We built you a fusion pellet! ...You BURIED it. WHY did you bury the pellet?!\""
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Night Court is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "⚔️ Avery stood down the raccoon with too many fingers and kept walking — 3 rounds, bloodied but breathing. It's still out there, somewhere."
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "⚔️ Farid stood down the raccoon with too many fingers and kept walking — 2 rounds, bloodied but breathing. It's still out there, somewhere."
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "📖 The memory leaves something behind: Page 12: deadfall diagrams. You remember drawing them."
    },
    {
      "day": 11,
      "line": "👂 Overheard — Driss: \"If the System wanted us dead we'd be dead. So what does it want instead?\""
    },
    {
      "day": 12,
      "line": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Anaconda Empress is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
    },
    {
      "day": 14,
      "line": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Avery is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
    },
    {
      "day": 14,
      "line": "◈ CRISIS — THE FIRST GRAVE. Avery is dead. The village digs its first grave, and everyone understands at once: this place can kill you. It just did."
    }
  ],
  "fightLines": [
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "You remember the Stone knife at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "You remember the Flannel Shirt at your space in the haven and fetch it — it rides in your pack now."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "line": "Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "line": "⚔️ Avery killed the creek went still alone — 5 rounds, 48 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."
    },
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "⚔️ Ella killed the moth the size of a dinner plate with their party — 3 rounds, 8 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "It sits up on its hind legs — hands moving too fast to follow. It's not looking at you. It's looking at your pack."
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "It circles once, eyes never leaving your pack — those hands never stop moving."
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "⚔️ Seamus killed the creek went still with their party — 5 rounds, 42 taken. Word travels fast. Took Wrong bandage off the body. The village cheers."
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "⚔️ Paraska killed the thing with headlights for eyes with their party — 9 rounds, 68 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "⚔️ Jada killed the Night Court with their party — 6 rounds, 47 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."
    },
    {
      "day": 10,
      "line": "🐺 HOWLS in the distance. Closer than before. The System chirps: \"Oh! We made those! Are they... too many? We can make fewer?\" (New monster: hushwolf pack.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 11,
      "line": "Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."
    },
    {
      "day": 12,
      "line": "Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."
    },
    {
      "day": 13,
      "line": "⚔️ Nikos killed the Anaconda Empress with their party — 10 rounds, 50 taken. Word travels fast. The village cheers."
    },
    {
      "day": 14,
      "line": "Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."
    },
    {
      "day": 14,
      "line": "The package sits in your pack, unopened. Opening it takes a day-part — the fans demand the full unboxing. (Use it from your pack when you have a morning to spend.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 14,
      "line": "\"Half rations for three days, voted and held — or a hard hunt now, hungry, to fill the bins before it's choosing-who-eats.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 14,
      "line": "Haven couldn't hold. On the third hungry day, people started walking — in different directions. The scattering, again."
    }
  ],
